4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair system for the bike spaces.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree, Asuka. But ""fair"" is tricky when we don't even know who's actually using the spots right now.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning rush is already a bottleneck. We need to know exactly how many bikes are actually leaving the building each day.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"And before anyone asks, what does this cost? I’m tired of proposals that ignore the budget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,And who maintains it? The last two roles we created just vanished because nobody wanted the paperwork.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, @Toshio, valid points. But we can't just guess. We need data to back up any decision.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, that sounds intense. I hope it’s not as bad as it sounds.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"It’s not about drama, it’s about logistics. If we don’t know the volume, we can’t size the solution.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, it’s not about drama, it’s about reality. If we don’t know the numbers, we’re just guessing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, agreed. I’ll look into the maintenance burden. @Shunichi, I’ll check the ledger for costs.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, checking the ledger is a start, but I need to know if this arrangement is actually causing friction. I’ll look into the complaint log.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I’ll check the sticker register to see who actually rides daily, and the minutes to see how the current spots were assigned.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I’ll watch the morning departures to count the actual volume, and check the rain exposure to see which spots are actually usable.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the ward cycle park rates and the treasurer’s handover file. We need to know the market price and the actual administrative load.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I’ll review the treasurer’s handover file for the workload, and the neighbouring block’s account to see how their system failed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I’ll also review the five years of association minutes to see if the current arrangement has ever been formally challenged.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’ll also check the supplier’s display frame trial to see if shared racks are even practical for us.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll also check the sticker register to see if daily riders would actually pay for a guaranteed spot.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll also check the building’s two-year ledger to see if we have any capital funds left for this.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll also review the last year’s complaint log to see if the current setup is already causing friction.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
