35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"- **Asuka**: The complaint log shows nine notes about bikes leaning on each other, but every single one died out because there was no one in particular to ask.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: Nine dead complaints. That’s not a system, that’s a vacuum.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Nine dead complaints. That’s not a system, that’s a vacuum.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The neighbouring block’s monthly charge left three households in arrears, and two stopped attending meetings entirely.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: The neighbouring block’s monthly charge left three households in arrears, and two stopped attending meetings entirely.""}]}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Toshio, that’s a warning. If we charge, we risk losing people from the room entirely.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Asuka, that’s scary. I hope we don’t end up with empty meetings.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Toshio, so a fee creates a class of people who just stop showing up?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, that’s a cautionary tale. But I need to know if we can even afford the alternative.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the ledger shows we have no capital funds. Any new infrastructure requires a levy on every household.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, so we are forced to choose between a fee that drives people away and a levy that costs everyone?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Asuka, that sounds like a lose-lose. I just want us to keep getting along, not start a war over money.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, not necessarily. The ledger shows the shared account is flat, but the ward park charges 2,600 yen monthly. If we price it right, we might cover costs without a levy.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the ward park has fourteen households waiting. We are not the only option, but we are the only one right here.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, exactly. The ledger is empty, so any capital work hits everyone. But the ward park’s waitlist proves demand is real, not just our problem.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, pricing it right is easy to say. The real risk is that the fee creates the exact social fracture I’m trying to avoid.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Asuka, I get that. But my sticker register shows daily riders would rather pay than be treated as equal claimants.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Yumi, that’s useful. But my morning watch showed four people shifting bikes just to leave. A fee doesn’t fix the physical bottleneck.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the bottleneck is real, but the ledger is empty. We can’t fix physics with money we don’t have.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the handover file shows three hours monthly just for current collections. Adding per-place billing would double that burden on whoever takes it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
